# Optional Supabase email/password sign-in. Local-first audit workflows still work without it.
# Use the Project URL and browser-safe publishable/anon key only.
# NEVER put service_role or sb_secret credentials in any VITE_* variable.
# Cloud authentication, optional snapshot sync, and private evidence require explicit project configuration.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
